    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d845">

                <pb facs="0727" n="717" xml:id="pg717"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.93/11–1749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Strong</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of state
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-17T15:00:00+07:00">November 17,
                            1949—3 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 17—6:56 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 1288. We are planning notify Foreign Office Friday November 18 of our
                    intention leave within next few days, destination depending on Chinese
                    Government, decisions and ensuing developments. Shall also advise foreign press
                    same day.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Strong</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
